          "level": 1,
          "text": "P07.3 + P08.1 — Independent Review (Wave 3)",
          "anchor": "p073-p081-independent-review-wave-3",
          "githubAnchor": "p073-p081-independent-review-wave-3",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c6d711b9b94d"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Part 1 — What I verified as genuinely correct",
          "anchor": "part-1-what-i-verified-as-genuinely-correct",
          "githubAnchor": "part-1-what-i-verified-as-genuinely-correct",
          "stableAnchor": "h-372aca548348"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.1 Terminal-transition authority is genuinely retained (P07.3 priority 1)",
          "anchor": "11-terminal-transition-authority-is-genuinely-retained-p073-priority-1",
          "githubAnchor": "11-terminal-transition-authority-is-genuinely-retained-p073-priority-1",
          "stableAnchor": "h-389f21451b45"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.2 The partial-cohort bypass is genuinely fixed in the shipped code (priority 2)",
          "anchor": "12-the-partial-cohort-bypass-is-genuinely-fixed-in-the-shipped-code-priority-2",
          "githubAnchor": "12-the-partial-cohort-bypass-is-genuinely-fixed-in-the-shipped-code-priority-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7cc1f156e5f3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.3 The `completion.mode` regression test is real (priority 3)",
          "anchor": "13-the-completionmode-regression-test-is-real-priority-3",
          "githubAnchor": "13-the-completionmode-regression-test-is-real-priority-3",
          "stableAnchor": "h-847010b44689"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.4 P08.1's closed enum and Non-Negotiable Deferral compliance (priority 4)",
          "anchor": "14-p081s-closed-enum-and-non-negotiable-deferral-compliance-priority-4",
          "githubAnchor": "14-p081s-closed-enum-and-non-negotiable-deferral-compliance-priority-4",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0863fce19219"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.5 P08.1's rejection tests are non-vacuous (priority 5)",
          "anchor": "15-p081s-rejection-tests-are-non-vacuous-priority-5",
          "githubAnchor": "15-p081s-rejection-tests-are-non-vacuous-priority-5",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4d78658581eb"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.6 P07.3's replay refusals are real forgeries, not mocks",
          "anchor": "16-p073s-replay-refusals-are-real-forgeries-not-mocks",
          "githubAnchor": "16-p073s-replay-refusals-are-real-forgeries-not-mocks",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9ad3b1e837e2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Part 2 — Findings",
          "anchor": "part-2-findings",
          "githubAnchor": "part-2-findings",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a7af3c01ca95"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "F1 — MEDIUM — The aggregation terminal gate is opt-in and currently unreachable in production; this makes the trace's headline residual over-weighted",
          "anchor": "f1-medium-the-aggregation-terminal-gate-is-opt-in-and-currently-unreachable-in-production-this-makes-the-traces-headline-residual-over-weighted",
          "githubAnchor": "f1-medium-the-aggregation-terminal-gate-is-opt-in-and-currently-unreachable-in-production-this-makes-the-traces-headline-residual-over-weighted",
          "stableAnchor": "h-001f75658d38"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "F2 — MEDIUM — P08.1's \"real Assignment/Run provenance\" is presence-only, and the gap is not disclosed",
          "anchor": "f2-medium-p081s-real-assignmentrun-provenance-is-presence-only-and-the-gap-is-not-disclosed",
          "githubAnchor": "f2-medium-p081s-real-assignmentrun-provenance-is-presence-only-and-the-gap-is-not-disclosed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f732341d8009"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "F3 — LOW — Duplicate `sourceOperationRefs` pass definition validation, then throw a foreign error type at runtime",
          "anchor": "f3-low-duplicate-sourceoperationrefs-pass-definition-validation-then-throw-a-foreign-error-type-at-runtime",
          "githubAnchor": "f3-low-duplicate-sourceoperationrefs-pass-definition-validation-then-throw-a-foreign-error-type-at-runtime",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9f1d3fb7879f"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "F4 — LOW — A source operation with zero declared bindings yields an unexplained `no-consensus`",
          "anchor": "f4-low-a-source-operation-with-zero-declared-bindings-yields-an-unexplained-no-consensus",
          "githubAnchor": "f4-low-a-source-operation-with-zero-declared-bindings-yields-an-unexplained-no-consensus",
          "stableAnchor": "h-69d125483e44"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "F5 — LOW — P08.1 lineage checks do not cover anchors or duplicate contribution ids",
          "anchor": "f5-low-p081-lineage-checks-do-not-cover-anchors-or-duplicate-contribution-ids",
          "githubAnchor": "f5-low-p081-lineage-checks-do-not-cover-anchors-or-duplicate-contribution-ids",
          "stableAnchor": "h-156fe8b71260"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
