          "level": 1,
          "text": "P10-KERNEL-FIX — Red-Team Recheck of Fix Round 2",
          "anchor": "p10-kernel-fix-red-team-recheck-of-fix-round-2",
          "githubAnchor": "p10-kernel-fix-red-team-recheck-of-fix-round-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2550cd25f10c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Verdict",
          "anchor": "verdict",
          "githubAnchor": "verdict",
          "stableAnchor": "h-40c85b039cce"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Method",
          "anchor": "method",
          "githubAnchor": "method",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7d2c4a5eb70a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "R2-HIGH-A — Fix Round 2's two HIGH fixes (N1 and N2/NEW-HIGH-A) ship with zero regression tests. Reverting them leaves the suite green.",
          "anchor": "r2-high-a-fix-round-2s-two-high-fixes-n1-and-n2new-high-a-ship-with-zero-regression-tests-reverting-them-leaves-the-suite-green",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-high-a-fix-round-2s-two-high-fixes-n1-and-n2new-high-a-ship-with-zero-regression-tests-reverting-them-leaves-the-suite-green",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d60ee2f87a63"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "R2-MEDIUM-B — `§5`'s N3 Gap states a scope that is factually false, and the false scope is what made it acceptable",
          "anchor": "r2-medium-b-5s-n3-gap-states-a-scope-that-is-factually-false-and-the-false-scope-is-what-made-it-acceptable",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-medium-b-5s-n3-gap-states-a-scope-that-is-factually-false-and-the-false-scope-is-what-made-it-acceptable",
          "stableAnchor": "h-026ed623c1bd"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "R2-MEDIUM-C — N1's new close refusal is unreachable through the only production caller, and `§10` does not say so",
          "anchor": "r2-medium-c-n1s-new-close-refusal-is-unreachable-through-the-only-production-caller-and-10-does-not-say-so",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-medium-c-n1s-new-close-refusal-is-unreachable-through-the-only-production-caller-and-10-does-not-say-so",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3ce6f22aee98"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "R2-MEDIUM-D — `§5`'s version-drift Gap bullet is stale: it still describes Fix Round 1, and points the reader at the section `§10.1` corrects as false",
          "anchor": "r2-medium-d-5s-version-drift-gap-bullet-is-stale-it-still-describes-fix-round-1-and-points-the-reader-at-the-section-101-corrects-as-false",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-medium-d-5s-version-drift-gap-bullet-is-stale-it-still-describes-fix-round-1-and-points-the-reader-at-the-section-101-corrects-as-false",
          "stableAnchor": "h-736b2dbe5cb3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "R2-LOW-E — the read-path degrade replaced NEW-HIGH-A's false `missing` with a false `completed`, silently, on the same command",
          "anchor": "r2-low-e-the-read-path-degrade-replaced-new-high-as-false-missing-with-a-false-completed-silently-on-the-same-command",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-low-e-the-read-path-degrade-replaced-new-high-as-false-missing-with-a-false-completed-silently-on-the-same-command",
          "stableAnchor": "h-97259909bb00"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What I attacked and found clean",
          "anchor": "what-i-attacked-and-found-clean",
          "githubAnchor": "what-i-attacked-and-found-clean",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9990c6d67b7c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Recommended actions, in order",
          "anchor": "recommended-actions-in-order",
          "githubAnchor": "recommended-actions-in-order",
          "stableAnchor": "h-207911b7781e"
        },
        {
