          "anchor": "medium-5-aggregation-exclusion-keyed-on-actoroperation-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-5-aggregation-exclusion-keyed-on-actoroperation-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a685e863e271"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-6, LOW-8 — present in §5 Gaps — **VERIFIED**",
