          "level": 1,
          "text": "P10-KERNEL-FIX — Reviewer Recheck 2 (independent verification of Fix Round 2)",
          "anchor": "p10-kernel-fix-reviewer-recheck-2-independent-verification-of-fix-round-2",
          "githubAnchor": "p10-kernel-fix-reviewer-recheck-2-independent-verification-of-fix-round-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3205d071db71"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "0. Method",
          "anchor": "0-method",
          "githubAnchor": "0-method",
          "stableAnchor": "h-64fc1da0ed91"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. Item-by-item verification",
          "anchor": "1-item-by-item-verification",
          "githubAnchor": "1-item-by-item-verification",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3ca542faac41"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N1 — close must refuse on a resolution failure: **VERIFIED FIXED**",
          "anchor": "n1-close-must-refuse-on-a-resolution-failure-verified-fixed",
          "githubAnchor": "n1-close-must-refuse-on-a-resolution-failure-verified-fixed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2a780183a463"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N2 / NEW-HIGH-A — a drifted read must report the pre-fix truth: **VERIFIED FIXED**",
          "anchor": "n2-new-high-a-a-drifted-read-must-report-the-pre-fix-truth-verified-fixed",
          "githubAnchor": "n2-new-high-a-a-drifted-read-must-report-the-pre-fix-truth-verified-fixed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ac87f653ab17"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "NEW-HIGH-B — the MEDIUM-5 regression test must be falsifiable: **VERIFIED FIXED**",
          "anchor": "new-high-b-the-medium-5-regression-test-must-be-falsifiable-verified-fixed",
          "githubAnchor": "new-high-b-the-medium-5-regression-test-must-be-falsifiable-verified-fixed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8f7836cde885"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N4 / NEW-MEDIUM-C — exclusion only when exactly one actor binds: **VERIFIED FIXED**",
          "anchor": "n4-new-medium-c-exclusion-only-when-exactly-one-actor-binds-verified-fixed",
          "githubAnchor": "n4-new-medium-c-exclusion-only-when-exactly-one-actor-binds-verified-fixed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-518be6473a80"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N3, NEW-LOW-D, 2+-actors — named as Gaps: **PRESENT** (one is factually wrong — see §2)",
          "anchor": "n3-new-low-d-2-actors-named-as-gaps-present-one-is-factually-wrong-see-2",
          "githubAnchor": "n3-new-low-d-2-actors-named-as-gaps-present-one-is-factually-wrong-see-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d4dce869b581"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N5 — test-count correction: **VERIFIED CORRECT**",
          "anchor": "n5-test-count-correction-verified-correct",
          "githubAnchor": "n5-test-count-correction-verified-correct",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1c53b3fb6712"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH-1 end-to-end: is the new error caught by `run.mjs`? **YES at the engine boundary; NO on the `run` verb — see R2-1**",
          "anchor": "high-1-end-to-end-is-the-new-error-caught-by-runmjs-yes-at-the-engine-boundary-no-on-the-run-verb-see-r2-1",
          "githubAnchor": "high-1-end-to-end-is-the-new-error-caught-by-runmjs-yes-at-the-engine-boundary-no-on-the-run-verb-see-r2-1",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b3a4873b13b9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. New findings from this recheck",
          "anchor": "2-new-findings-from-this-recheck",
          "githubAnchor": "2-new-findings-from-this-recheck",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5453ea082c34"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R2-1 (MEDIUM) — §5's N3 Gap misstates its own scope, and N1's user-visible fix does not land on the `run` verb",
          "anchor": "r2-1-medium-5s-n3-gap-misstates-its-own-scope-and-n1s-user-visible-fix-does-not-land-on-the-run-verb",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-1-medium-5s-n3-gap-misstates-its-own-scope-and-n1s-user-visible-fix-does-not-land-on-the-run-verb",
          "stableAnchor": "h-381030580da0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R2-2 (MEDIUM) — §7.5 was corrected for the count but left stale in four other ways",
          "anchor": "r2-2-medium-75-was-corrected-for-the-count-but-left-stale-in-four-other-ways",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-2-medium-75-was-corrected-for-the-count-but-left-stale-in-four-other-ways",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e7a659071fa0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R2-3 (LOW) — §10.6's quoted `git status --short` does not reproduce",
          "anchor": "r2-3-low-106s-quoted-git-status---short-does-not-reproduce",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-3-low-106s-quoted-git-status---short-does-not-reproduce",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c606c426502e"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R2-4 (LOW) — the degraded read has no signal at all, in either failure class",
          "anchor": "r2-4-low-the-degraded-read-has-no-signal-at-all-in-either-failure-class",
          "githubAnchor": "r2-4-low-the-degraded-read-has-no-signal-at-all-in-either-failure-class",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f3dba6c07a6c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Regression evidence — numbers I personally observed",
          "anchor": "3-regression-evidence-numbers-i-personally-observed",
          "githubAnchor": "3-regression-evidence-numbers-i-personally-observed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7cfeb5554621"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. Newly-broken checks — none found",
          "anchor": "4-newly-broken-checks-none-found",
